      "prompt": "Pixel art sprite sheet, 4 frames in a single horizontal row, equal spacing, solid flat magenta #FF00FF background. Angled perspective of a spinning 12-inch black vinyl disc on a Technics turntable platter. Realistic micro-pixel groove light reflections rotating clockwise, spinning center circular record label with red and cream tones, stroboscopic rim dots. Palette matched to the warm amber, mahogany, and deep vinyl charcoal of battle_pub.png.",
