  "notes": "Deep amber pub atmosphere: warm hanging filament bulbs swaying on cords, rich mahogany shelves, glowing violet Technics logos and pulsing blue strobe LEDs. Both turntables spin with hand-crafted vinyl groove reflections while mixer VU LEDs pulse to a 92 BPM boom-bap rhythm. Bass drop shake and beat zooms emphasize old-school beats before Barti joins the crew."
